@Ptahtrade
The project has been live for less than a day. When it first launched, my first reaction was worry that it was just an AI gimmick wrapped around RAG. After a quick hands-on try, I can see it has real, practical design—much better than I expected, mainly because participation now comes with multipliers 😆.

This NFT has a hard minting threshold: you can only mint through the Binance Agent AI wallet; regular Web3 wallets can't mint. 10 #Relics can be burned to synthesize #Loom. The highlight is that AI agents can automatically execute the synthesis command—no need for us to manually click through contract operations. That's a real positive for Binance's AI trading track. Before, most people opened Binance AI wallets just to run automated trading scripts; now AI Agents can have their own on-chain NFT identity credentials, and AI capabilities are no longer limited to watching the market, placing...

